urns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Core governance**\n- Board of trustees (independent majority) approving the advisory contract under Section 15(c)\n- Registered adviser and any sub-adviser\n- CCO (Rule 38a-1)\n- Fund and independent-trustee counsel\n- Independent auditor\n- Valuation designee (Rule 2a-5) and liquidity program administrator (Rule 22e-4), usually the adviser\n\n**Service providers (often bundled)**\n- Custodian, administrator/accountant and transfer agent, often one bank\n- Distributor/principal underwriter (registered broker-dealer)\n- Series-trust/white-label platforms can package board, CCO, administration and distribution\n\n**Market infrastructure**\n- Exchange listing and lead market maker\n- CUSIP and DTC/NSCC eligibility\n- AP agreements and Rule 6c-11-compliant basket/creation-redemption process\n- Daily website disclosures\n\n**Strategy-specific**\n- Index license and calculation agent (index ETFs)\n- Securities-lending agent, often the custodian\n- Derivatives risk manager (Rule 18f-4) and ISDA/FCM counterparties\n- Exemptive relief for semi-transparent structures","ttft_ms":8125,"type":"result","duration_ms":10685,"uuid":"9fc97956-2d56-4516-be48-553711c47afc","ttft_stream_ms":1536,"time_to_request_ms":68,"first_content_frame_ms":1536,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
